{"ID":"20250224124408-10ioi6i","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250224124408-10ioi6i","title":"A4L2——链表","type":"doc","updated":"20250224130149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124408-iwq7iyh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250224124408-iwq7iyh","updated":"20250224125207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"链表"}]},{"ID":"20250224124436-j1ah11x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124436-j1ah11x","updated":"20250224124440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存空间是所有程序的公共资源，在一个复杂的系统运行环境下，空闲的内存空间可能散落在内存各处。\n我们知道，存储数组的内存空间必须是连续的，而当数组非常大时，内存可能无法提供如此大的连续空间。此时链表的灵活性优势就体现出来了。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124436-ob5hh0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124436-ob5hh0l","updated":"20250224124449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"链表（linked list）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是一种线性数据结构，其中的每个元素都是一个节点对象，各个节点通过“引用”相连接。\n引用记录了下一个节点的内存地址，通过它可以从当前节点访问到下一个节点。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124436-o665uj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124436-o665uj5","updated":"20250224124436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"链表的设计使得各个节点可以分散存储在内存各处，它们的内存地址无须连续。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124456-qurrsx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124456-qurrsx8","updated":"20250224124456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 636px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240910005133-gx2jmhi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 636px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250224124605-7vk46is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-7vk46is","updated":"20250224124613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"观察上图，链表的组成单位是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"节点（node）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对象。每个节点都包含两项数据：节点的“值”和指向下一节点的“引用”。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124605-hghnr93","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-hghnr93","updated":"20250224124605"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124605-0q9wgjv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-0q9wgjv","updated":"20250224124605"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124605-mlrr8lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-mlrr8lt","updated":"20250224124605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"链表的首个节点被称为“头节点”，最后一个节点被称为“尾节点”。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124605-942zcy3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-942zcy3","updated":"20250224124605"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124605-bpgk7p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-bpgk7p8","updated":"20250224124605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尾节点指向的是“空”，它在 Java、C++ 和 Python 中分别被记为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"null"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nullptr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"None"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124605-pvyqhqx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-pvyqhqx","updated":"20250224124605"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124605-arvo65x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-arvo65x","updated":"20250224124605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 C、C++、Go 和 Rust 等支持指针的语言中，上述“引用”应被替换为“指针”。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124605-qoahdb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124605-qoahdb6","updated":"20250224124605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如以下代码所示，链表节点 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ListNode"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 除了包含值，还需额外保存一个引用（指针）。因此在相同数据量下，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"链表比数组占用更多的内存空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124637-z31rc3h","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250224124637-z31rc3h","updated":"20250224124648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/* 链表节点类 */\nclass ListNode(int x) {  //构造函数\n    int val = x;         // 节点值\n    ListNode? next;      // 指向下一节点的引用\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250224124819-r7re0dl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250224124819-r7re0dl","updated":"20250224125207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数组 vs. 链表"}]},{"ID":"20250224124828-sp8gxkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124828-sp8gxkm","updated":"20250224124831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下表总结了数组和链表的各项特点并对比了操作效率。由于它们采用两种相反的存储策略，因此各种性质和操作效率也呈现对立的特点。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124836-grosghf","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;","id":"20250224124836-grosghf","updated":"20250224125035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th"},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数组"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"链表"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存储方式"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"连续内存空间"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分散内存空间"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"容量拓展"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长度不可变"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可灵活拓展"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存效率"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元素占用内存少"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元素占用内存多"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"访问元素"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"添加元素"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"删除元素"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125207-i1ecrnd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250224125207-i1ecrnd","updated":"20250224125317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常见链表类型"}]},{"ID":"20250224125216-1rasxot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125216-1rasxot","updated":"20250224125220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常见的链表类型包括三种："}]},{"ID":"20250224125216-w0di7ir","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125216-w0di7ir","updated":"20250224125216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125216-1uovvns","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125216-1uovvns","updated":"20250224125216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125216-dc38t6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125216-dc38t6k","updated":"20250224125216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"单向链表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：即前面介绍的普通链表。单向链表的节点包含值和指向下一节点的引用两项数据。我们将首个节点称为头节点，将最后一个节点称为尾节点，尾节点指向空 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"None"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125216-6k7ifg7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125216-6k7ifg7","updated":"20250224125216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125216-15yo9yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125216-15yo9yt","updated":"20250224125216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"环形链表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：如果我们令单向链表的尾节点指向头节点（首尾相接），则得到一个环形链表。在环形链表中，任意节点都可以视作头节点。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125216-okkmzg5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125216-okkmzg5","updated":"20250224125216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125216-kjcv8so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125216-kjcv8so","updated":"20250224125216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"双向链表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：与单向链表相比，双向链表记录了两个方向的引用。双向链表的节点定义同时包含指向后继节点（下一个节点）和前驱节点（上一个节点）的引用（指针）。相较于单向链表，双向链表更具灵活性，可以朝两个方向遍历链表，但相应地也需要占用更多的内存空间。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125240-uo8opep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125240-uo8opep","updated":"20250224125240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250224125240-02lawq0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250224125317-gkgpzag","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250224125317-gkgpzag","updated":"20250224130149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"链表典型应用"}]},{"ID":"20250224125325-uirgo78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125325-uirgo78","updated":"20250224125326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单向链表通常用于实现栈、队列、哈希表和图等数据结构。"}]},{"ID":"20250224125602-p5vocxd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125602-p5vocxd","updated":"20250224130149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125602-1brao40","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125602-1brao40","updated":"20250224130149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125602-pwzeltl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125602-pwzeltl","updated":"20250224125602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"栈与队列"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：当插入和删除操作都在链表的一端进行时，它表现的特性为先进后出，对应栈；当插入操作在链表的一端进行，删除操作在链表的另一端进行，它表现的特性为先进先出，对应队列。"}]},{"ID":"20250224125605-o8s6xis","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250224125605-o8s6xis","updated":"20250224130149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250224125606-j6gd9wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125606-j6gd9wa","updated":"20250224130149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注：C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中自带的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Stack\u0026lt;T\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Queue\u0026lt;T\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是实际上基于动态数组的"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125602-8g75e5p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125602-8g75e5p","updated":"20250224125602"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125602-t18hxkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125602-t18hxkq","updated":"20250224125602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"哈希表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：链式地址是解决哈希冲突的主流方案之一，在该方案中，所有冲突的元素都会被放到一个链表中。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125602-y2a848o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125602-y2a848o","updated":"20250224125602"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125602-lq5nfgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125602-lq5nfgn","updated":"20250224125602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"图"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：邻接表是表示图的一种常用方式，其中图的每个顶点都与一个链表相关联，链表中的每个元素都代表与该顶点相连的其他顶点。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125927-cevqwk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125927-cevqwk8","updated":"20250224125933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双向链表常用于需要快速查找前一个和后一个元素的场景。"}]},{"ID":"20250224125938-r533rog","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125938-r533rog","updated":"20250224125938"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125938-gpyfpk1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125938-gpyfpk1","updated":"20250224125938"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125938-os7nlu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125938-os7nlu3","updated":"20250224125938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"高级数据结构"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：比如在红黑树、B 树中，我们需要访问节点的父节点，这可以通过在节点中保存一个指向父节点的引用来实现，类似于双向链表。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125938-93gmem0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125938-93gmem0","updated":"20250224125938"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125938-omn9n6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125938-omn9n6k","updated":"20250224125938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"浏览器历史"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：在网页浏览器中，当用户点击前进或后退按钮时，浏览器需要知道用户访问过的前一个和后一个网页。双向链表的特性使得这种操作变得简单。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125938-sj441t7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125938-sj441t7","updated":"20250224125938"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125938-8ldg1qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125938-8ldg1qh","updated":"20250224125938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"LRU 算法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：在缓存淘汰（LRU）算法中，我们需要快速找到最近最少使用的数据，以及支持快速添加和删除节点。这时候使用双向链表就非常合适。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125947-6sqa6ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125947-6sqa6ys","updated":"20250224125948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"环形链表常用于需要周期性操作的场景，比如操作系统的资源调度。"}]},{"ID":"20250224125953-rd8eosh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125953-rd8eosh","updated":"20250224125953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125953-o98quoy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125953-o98quoy","updated":"20250224125953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125953-xge6u3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125953-xge6u3l","updated":"20250224125953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时间片轮转调度算法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：在操作系统中，时间片轮转调度算法是一种常见的 CPU 调度算法，它需要对一组进程进行循环。每个进程被赋予一个时间片，当时间片用完时，CPU 将切换到下一个进程。这种循环操作可以通过环形链表来实现。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224125953-a3tve6a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224125953-a3tve6a","updated":"20250224125953"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224125953-1z515e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224125953-1z515e2","updated":"20250224125953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"数据缓冲区"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：在某些数据缓冲区的实现中，也可能会使用环形链表。比如在音频、视频播放器中，数据流可能会被分成多个缓冲块并放入一个环形链表，以便实现无缝播放。"}]}]}]}]}